sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Doc as Doctor
    actor Pat as Patient
    actor Ph as Pharmacy staff
    participant UI as React app
    participant API as Express API
    participant DB as MySQL (Azure)
    Doc->>UI: write prescription
    UI->>API: POST /api/prescriptions
    API->>DB: BEGIN, insert prescription, items, reminders and an audit row, then COMMIT
    API-->>UI: 201 + interaction warnings
    Pat->>UI: open "Today"
    UI->>API: GET /api/reminders
    API->>DB: reminders of this patient only
    Pat->>UI: mark dose taken
    UI->>API: PATCH /api/reminders/:id/status
    Ph->>UI: open pending prescription
    UI->>API: POST /api/pharmacies/:id/prescriptions/:rx/dispense
    API->>DB: BEGIN, lock the batches (FOR UPDATE), take stock oldest-expiry first, record dispensed_items, mark DISPENSED, then COMMIT
    API-->>UI: 200, or 400 with nothing changed if stock is short
